# Public Thoroughfare: only an untapped artifact or land *you control* pays. On turn 3 Bot1 has tapped its Mox Emerald and has an untapped Llanowar
# Elves (a creature, neither artifact nor land); Bot2's Mox Ruby is an untapped artifact but is not Bot1's. Nothing can pay, so it is not asked
# and the Thoroughfare is sacrificed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Public Thoroughfare
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Public Thoroughfare.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Decline

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Llanowar Elves; Mox Emerald
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = false
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Tapped = false
Bot1.Graveyard = Public Thoroughfare
